# Copy to .env and fill in. Never commit .env — gitleaks will block it.
#
# Document every variable the app reads, with a safe placeholder value.
# A missing entry here is the most common cause of a broken first-run.

# Example:
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@localhost:5432/dbname
# API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:3000
# LOG_LEVEL=debug
